{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">據了解，警方以涉嫌普通襲擊及公眾地方內擾亂秩序行為等罪，拘捕四名男童，懷疑在荃灣公園用濕紙巾擲途人。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上流傳片段見到，有男童一邊騎單車，一邊用濕紙巾擲向多名途人。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ARREST-1500_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026T2JbKFvGSu1784711120.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.ARREST-1500_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">據了解警方接獲兩名男子報案，指分別在剛過去的周六及周日晚，於荃灣公園海濱長廊及單車徑，被6至7名騎單車的青少年，用濕紙巾襲擊背部，警方調查後採取拘捕行動，今日稍後會交代案情。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-22T09:50:02.820327+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}